Added only [tests/test_simulation_astra.py](/Users/ottogonzalez/Documents/rover/V1/tests/test_simulation_astra.py). Ran the requested command:

```text
.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_simulation_astra.py
24 failed, 9 passed in 0.79s
